            <div xml:id="d1017">

                <pb facs="1099" n="1087" xml:id="pg1087"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 EW/11–1745: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Kirk</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-11-17T13:00:00-05:00">November 17,
                            1945—1 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2123. Pls inform FonOff that we have given careful and sympathetic consideration
                    to Ital request for revision of armistice regime and are prepared to accede to
                    Ital request provided other govts signatory to Armistice concur. Accordingly,
                    Dept is informing other signatories of American position and inquiring re their
                    attitude.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Byrnes</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
